                        "review": "[h1]      ⚖️  MATCHING EXPECTATION:[/h1] \n* 🟢 = Available = Fun +1\n* 🔴 = Not Available = Fun -1\n* Match Nothing = 0 Fun\n\n🟢 Powerful Weapons\n🟢 Large Groups of Enemies with different pattern\n🟢 Weapon Combination\n🟢 Score Attack for replay value\n🟢 Local Coop\n🔴 Remastered Version\n🔴 Shield Ability\n🔴 Slow Motion Ability\n🔴 Casual Difficulty\n🔴 Long Hours Content\n\n[table]\n    [tr]\n        [th]fMeter[/th]\n        [th]FUN[/th]\n        [th]fUN METER[/th]\n        [th]DISCOUNT[/th]\n [th]COMMUNITY[/th]\n        [th]REVIEWER[/th]\n    [/tr]\n    [tr]\n        [th]A+[/th]\n        [td]5[/td]\n        [td]Loving it [/td]\n        [td]No Wait[/td]\n        [td] -[/td]\n        [td] -[/td]\n    [/tr]\n    [tr]\n        [th]A[/th]\n        [td]4[/td]\n        [td]Liked it[/td]\n        [td]No Wait[/td]\n        [td] -[/td]\n        [td] -[/td]\n    [/tr]\n    [tr]\n        [th]B[/th]\n        [td]2-3[/td]\n        [td]Half satisfied[/td]\n        [td]Wait 50%[/td]\n        [td] ✔[/td]\n        [td] ✔[/td]\n    [/tr]\n    [tr]\n        [th]C[/th]\n        [td] 1[/td]\n        [td]Less interested[/td]\n        [td]Wait 75%[/td]\n        [td] -[/td]\n        [td] -[/td]\n    [/tr]\n    [tr]\n        [th]D[/th]\n        [td] 0[/td]\n        [td]Not what you need[/td]\n        [td]Wait 100%[/td]\n        [td] -[/td]\n        [td] -[/td]\n    [/tr]\n[/table]\n\n🏅 Community Rating: [b] Mostly Positive  [/b]\n⚖️ [b]fMeter {B}[/b] Worth a play, if you want a better version of DELTAZEAL. However, if you're looking for Casual Difficulty, don't play it\n\n🔎 Check the full list for your preferred gameplay 👇 [u][i]https://steamcommunity.com/groups/expectationchecklist/discussions/1/573801267689717651/[/i][/u]\n\n[h1] 🕘          IMPRESSION:[/h1]\n* Year 2004: Game released on Arcade Machine\n* Year 2016: Game released on PC\n* Year 2026: Started playtest for the first time\n* 1.6 hour later: Finish all six stages :)\n* 2.2 hour later: Hunting Achievements now :)\n\n[h1]  🔊         TESTER MUST KNOW:[/h1]\n* Rebind control keys by pressing left and right\n* Player have no shield at all = 1 hit will end a life\n* Touching enemy will consider ending life\n* Score will reset when player use the continue credit\n* Black Hole = Neutralize enemy bullets + Damaging enemies\n* Completion is about 30+ min long campaign mission\n* We can unlock a hidden playable ship from Triangle Service's classic XII Stag (XII Zeal) by entering a secret button code on the main title screen\n\n[h1] ⭐️         COMPARE TO DELTAZEAL:[/h1]\n* 2 Years newer production\n* Improved Graphic\n* Improved Weapon\n* Improved Level Design\n* 3 Weapon now can be swap manually\n* 6 Stages instead of 9 stages\n* Slower Bomb\n* Added hidden ship with new ability\n* Removed the Black Hole ability\n\n[h1] 💎 SAME GENRE COMPARISON:[/h1]\n* Allow to mix 3 type weapons at the same time\n* Allow to adjust specify weapon fire-power\n* Action packed 3D world\n* Optional to rotate the monitor setting to be horizontal\n* Optional to scale XY of the game screen to fill in the blank\n* Good gaming music\n\n[h1]  ⚠️        RUMOR CHECKING:[/h1]\n* It has a surprisingly good replay-oriented design ➜ Agree, a better version of DELTAZEAL\n* Visual clarity is a genuine criticism ➜ I think only happen for the final stage\n* The game has meaningful score-based replay value ➜ Agree\n* The controls can feel heavy & pacing is very slow➜ Disagree\n\n[quote]\n[b]Remember  to 👍 for me if you liked this review:[/b]\n🔔 More similar reviews ➜ [u][url=http://store.steampowered.com/curator/31940448-Expectation-Checklist/]Browse Here[/url][/u] and follow this Curator, or\n🤝 Visit Our Gaming Discussion ➜ [u] [url=https://steamcommunity.com/groups/expectationchecklist]We're Here[/url][/u]\n📢 Disclaimer regarding Short Hours & English Errors ➜ [u][url=https://steamcommunity.com/groups/expectationchecklist/discussions/0/4594180031254224809/]Read Here[/url][/u]\n[/quote]",
